<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- AUSHI BIBLE TRANSLATION</book>
  <para style="toc1">Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yak</para>
  <para style="mt2">INKALATA YAKWA</para>
  <para style="mt1">YAKOBO</para>
  <para style="imt">UBULONDOLOSHI</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyi nklata yalembelwe na Yakobo uyo limbi ali ni munyina lyakwa Yesu. Uwaishile kube ntungulushi mu lukuta lwapa kutampa kabili alikwetemo lubali mu kilye kya mu Yelusalemu (Imilimo Yabatumwa 15.13). Umutumwa Paulo naye amulondolola ukuba ulukeshi mu lukuta (Galatia 2.9). Abasambilila malembo balisumino kwebati iki kitabo kyalembelwe libe umwaka wa 50 AD taulafika. Apo Yakobo ali ni ntungulushi ya likuta mu Yelusalemu, limbi alembele ulo ali kwikala mulya mwine.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yakobo alembele ku mitundu ikumi limo na babili abasalaganine mu mishobo (1.1). Amasambililo yabamo kuti yabomfeshiwa na bena Klistu na bena Klistu fye bonse nangula pakutampa yabalilwepo kulembelwa Abayuda abali bena Klistu. Apo iki kitabo kyalembelwe pakwebati kibelengwe ku bantu akuti ubwingi, kyalilanda pa milandu ya kupusana pusana. Yakobo alilolekeshe sana kwaba pa kiteketelo ne milimo ati kiteketelo kine nene kulalangwa mu fikitwa (2.17). Abakengeshako na pa mulandu wa kukanakwata kapatulula 2.1-4. Alanda na pafyo tulingile ukuba bakukengela pafyo tulanda 3.1-12.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ubutantiko</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulo aposhapo bakabelenga (1.1)</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abakoselesha ukushipikisha mu makyushi 1.2-27</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ubukankala bwaba mu kiteketelo ne milimo 2.1-27</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Panuma alanda pafyo amashiwi yakwata maka 3.1-12</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Alondolola pafyo amano yakwa Lesa yapusana na mano ya pesonde 3.3–4.10</para>
  <para style="io1">6. Abakengeshako na palwa mataki 4.11—5.6</para>
  <para style="io1">7. Mukusondwelela, Yakobo akumbinkanya masambilisho yonse pamo 5.7-20</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Nebo ne Yakobo, umusha wakwa Lesa na Shikulu Yesu Klistu, nkomiposha bonse mwe mitundu ikumi limo na shibili isha bantu bakwa Lesa abasalangana inko shonse.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulekuba abakisumino na mano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Mwe bawesu, amakyushi ya misango ne misango nga yakomishila, mulekubona ati mulishukile sana! <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />Pantu mulishibile ati ulo ikisumino kyenu kikoeshiwa ku makyushi, kilalenga ukushipikisha. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Ukushipikisha kwenu kukaboneka sana mufyo mukobomba, epakwebati mulekuba abakupwililika lonse, abatabulisha nangu kimo. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Umo pali mwebo nga takwete mano, alombe kuli Lesa pakwebati amupeele. Lesa naye alapeela ne nsansa onse uukomulomba, akamipeela. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Lelo uyu wine ulo akopepa, alilingile ukukwata ikisumino, ukwakubula ukutwishika. Pantu umuntu nga kotwishika, alapala ibimbi lya pa nika ilikotumpauka no kusendwa konse uko umwela ukopuungila. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Umuntu wakubefi, tafwile kutontonkanya ati Shikulu akamupeela ikyo akolomba. <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Aliba fye uwakubula ukushininkisha ifyo akomfwaya ukukita, imikitile yakwe yakwaluka aluka fye.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubupina no bukankala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Wenu umupina alilingile ukumfwa ubune pakyo Lesa amukindamika. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Umukankala wesu naye alilingele ukumfwa ubune pali ikyo Lesa alimupelako ubukindami. Pantu umukankala akalukuta nge luba lya kyani. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Akasuba nga kakotula, katampa no kukuuma, ukukaba kwakako kulalenga ikyani ukuma. Amaluba ya kyani yalalukuta no kuyemba kwakiko kulaapwa. Mu musango umo wine efyo umukankala akonaulwa pa nshita alikupamfiwa na makwebo yakwe.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubwesho ne tuunko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Alishukile umuntu uukoshipikisha mu makyushi. Pantu nga akimfya amakyushi, akapokelela ikilambu kya mweo ikyo Lesa alaya aba mutemwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Umo nga kotunkwa elekutontonkanya ati ni Lesa eukomutunka. Pantu Lesa tekuti atunkwe ne fyabipa, elo umwine wine tatunka muntu. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Lelo muntu atunkwa ulo ulunkumbwa lwakwe lwa musembeleka no ku mwikata. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Ulunkumbwa nga lwakula, lulakuta ububifi. Ububifi nga bwakula, bulakuta imfwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Ala mwilekubepwa mwe bawesu! <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Ifya bupe fyonse ifyabune efyo tupokelela ne fyawamisha umupwilapo filafuma kwiulu. Filafuma kuli Lesa Tata uwabumbile ifya mwiulu ifipeela ulubuuto. Muli ena tamwaba mfinshi, kabili taaluka nge kinshingwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Lesa umwine ku kufwaya kwakwe ewatufyele kwishiwi lyakwe ilyakinshinka. Alikitile ifi pantu alikufwaya ati tube abantanshi pa fibumbwa fyakwe fyonse.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumfwa amashiwi yakwa Lesa no kuyanakila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Ishibeni iki mwe bawesu, umuntu onse alilingile ukumfwa kangu, lelo uwakutekanya pakulanda, kabili uutafulwa kangu. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Pantu ikifukushi kya muntu takileta bololoke ubo Lesa afwaya. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Kanshi talukeni ku fyakukowela fyonse ne misango ibi yonse mukili nayo. Mulekunakila Lesa no kupokelela amashiwi yakwe ayo abyala mu mitima yenu ayakuba na maka yakumipususha. <verse eid="JAS 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Mwilekuibepa mukupelela fye pakumfwa amashiwi yakwe, lelo mulekukita nefyo yakomyeba. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Umuntu uumfwa fye amashiwi lelo takita ifyo yakomweba, aba kubati muntu uukoilolesha pa menso mu kilolani. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Kilya apwa ukuilolesha afumapo, pekapo alaba nefyo aboneka. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Lelo umuntu uukololesha mu mafunde ya kupwililika ilitulenga ukuba abantungwa, kabili akokonkanyapo ukuyanakila, tapelela fye mukumfwa alaba nako lelo akokita ifyo omfwa, ninshi Lesa akamipaala muli fyonse ifyo akokita. <verse eid="JAS 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Bushe ulalanda ati ndi mwina Lesa? Nga waba kilandelande ninshi ukoibepa fye no bwina Lesa bobe nabo bwa fye fye. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Ubwina Lesa ubo Lesa Shikulu abona ati bwalipwililika ku bune, kwafwa bakashiwa na ba mukamfwilwa mufyo bakokabila no kuitalusha ku fyakukowela fya pano kyalo.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Mwilekukita munkishanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Mwe bawesu, epo mwalisumina mu Shikulu Yesu Klistu, Shikulu wa bukindami, mwilekuba na kapatulula. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Nga kyakwebati umukankala alifwele ingalaminwe ya golide ne nsalu shamutengo, nga aisa mu ng'anda mulongene, elo no mupina uwasapula naye aisamo. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Nga mwapokelela bwino uufwele ifyabusaka, mwa mweba ati, “Ikaleni apa pa kipuna apabune.” Umupina naye mwamweba ati, “Kemakane uko nangu ikala panshi mupepi na nebo.” <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />Bushe ninshi tali kapatulula mwakita? Bushe ninshi tali mano yabubi mwabomfya mukupingula? <verse eid="JAS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Umfweni mwebo bawesu mwe batemwikwa bangi! Lesa alasala abantu, abo bantu ba pano kyalo babakuuta abapina ukuba abakankala mu kisumino. Alabasala ukupyana Ubufumu ubo Lesa alaya abamutemwa. <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Lelo mwebo mukosausha abapina! Ni bani bakomi fyengelesha no ku mipatikisha ukuya ku kilye? Bushe tali bakankala? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Bushe tali bakankala basaalula ishina ilikindami lyakwa Klistu ilyo mwainikwako? <verse eid="JAS 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Nga mulalungika, amunakila ikyebo ikikuulu ikyalembwa mu malembo ya Mushilo ikilanda ati, “Ulekutemwa umunobe nge fyo waitemwa we mwine.” <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Lelo nga mukokita akapatulula ninshi mukobifya, kabili ukulingana na mafunde, ninshi namutoba amafunde. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Uyo onse uukosunga amafunde yakwa Lesa yonse, nga pula fye muli limo, ninshi alikwete umulandu kubati apulafye muli yonse. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Lesa alipeele ikyebo kyakwebati, “Wile kukita bukende” ne kyakwebati, “Wilaipaya.” Kanshi nangu taubemwike, lelo ukoipaya abantu, ninshi nishi namutoba amafunde. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Imilandile ne mikitile yenu ilekuba nge ya bantu abakopingulwa ne funde ilikolenga tulekuba abantungwa. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Pantu Lesa takakwate luse pakupingula umuntu uutali na luse ku mu nankwe. Uluse lwalikindama pa bupingushi.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikisumino ne milimo yabune</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Mwe bawesu, umo nga kolanda ati ndikwete kisumino nomba takobomba nangu kimo, bushe iki kisumino kuti kya muwamina ndo? Bushe iki kisumino kyakwe kuti kya mupususha? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Nomba nga kyakwebati wenu, alisapwile, elo ne fyakulya takwete, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />bushe kikabawamina shani nga umo pali mwebo abeba ati, “Mwende umutende, mulekufwala mulekukaba, mulekulya mulekwikuta,” nga tamubapeele ifi fintu bakokabila mu bumi bwabo? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Kanshi efyo ne kisumino kyaba, nga takikobomba imilimo ninshi kyalifwa. <verse eid="JAS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Limo umo kuti alanda ati, “Webo ulikweete ikisumino, na nebo ndabomba imilimo yabune.” Pakwasuka kuti na mweba ati, “Kisuma, webo nanga ikisumino kyobe ukwakubula imilimo yabune, na nebo nkokulanga ikisumino kyandi mu milimo iyo moomba!” <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Bushe uukosumina ati kwaliba fye Lesa umo? Kisuma! Ne mipashi yakukowela nayo yalisumina, kabili ilatutuma no kututuma ku mwenso. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />We kyungwa kya muntu we, bushe ukofwaya nkulange ati ikisumino ikyakubula imilimo yabune kya fye fye? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Bushe kindo kyalengele ati Ablahamu ikikolwe kyesu abe uwakaele pa kinso kyakwa Lesa? Ala ni pa milimo yakwe yabune, ulo atuulile umwana Isaki pakipailo pakwebati apeele ilambo. <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Wabona ati ikisumino ne milimo yakwe iyabune fyalibombele pamo. Ne milimo yakwe yabune yalengele ati ikisumino kyakwe kibe ikyakupwililika. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Ne fyalembwa mu Malembo ya Mushilo fyalifikilishe ifyakwebati, “Ablahamu alisumine mu Lesa, na pa mulandu wa kisumino kyakwe, Lesa alimubwene ukuba uwakaele pa kinso kyakwe.” Kabili ekyo Ablahamu alikukutilwa ati ni kibusa wakwa Lesa. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Mwabona nomba ati, Lesa tabona muntu ati wakaele pa kinso kyakwe pa mulandu wa kisumino fye kyeka, lelo na pa mulandu wa milimo yabune. <verse eid="JAS 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Epamo na ku mwanakashi Lahabu kilende. Lesa alimubwene ati wakaele pa kinso kyakwe pafyo akitile. Alipokelele inengu sha bena Islaeli shibili, alishafwilisheko no kufyuka mukubomfya inshila imbi. <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Nga filya umubili wa muntu ufwa ulo umupashi wafumamo, efyo ne kisumino kiba ikyafwa nga takikobomba imilimo yabune.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Mulekusunga ululimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Mwe bawesu, pali mwebo peba bakafundisha abengi, pantu fwebo fwe bakafundisha, tukapingulwa ukukishamo. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Fwebo bonse ilingi tulalufyanya. Nomba umuntu nga takolufyanya mufyo akolanda, ninshi uyo wakupwililika. Kabili ninshi uyu muntu alikweete amaka yakutungulula umubili wakwe onse. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Tulabika ikyela mu kanwa kakwa kabalwe pakwebati alekukita efyo tukofwaya. Nga twakitefi tulalenga kabalwe ukuya konse uko tukofwaya. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Tontonkanyeni pali kibwange ikyenda pali bemba. Nangu kikule shani, kabili nangu kisendwe ne kipuupu ikyakukosa shani, kipindululwa fye kuli kankafi akanini, no kuya konse uko kyoba wa bwange akofwaya ati kiye. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Ululimi nalo efyo lwaba. nangu lwaliba akapande ka mubili akanini, lulailumba ati lulakita ifyakusungusha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Tontonkanyeni efyo impanga iinkulu balayokya fye ku kamulilo akanini. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Ulumini nalo lwaliba kubati mulilo. Pa filundwa fya mibili yesu, ulumini lwaliba kubati kyalo ikyaisulamo ububi bonse, lulasalanganya ububi mu mubili onse. Lulabyala umulilo mu bumi bwesu bonse ubwa pano kyalo kabili lwena lulafumya uyu mulilo ku mulilo ku gehena. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Umuntu kuti ateeka inama sha mpaanga, ifyuni, ifikulika pa mushili ne sabi ukuba ifitekwa fya mu mushi. Nakuba tulafiteeka fyonse ifi. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Lelo takungaba uwinganasha ulumini. Lwena taluupema pa bubi, lwalisulamo no busungu ubwipaya. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Ku lumini tulalumbanyako Shikulu kabili Tata, elo kabili tula lapishishako abantu banensu ebo Lesa abumba mu kyata kyakwe. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Mu kanwa kamo kene mulafuma ukutasha no kulapisha. Bawesu ifi tefyo kifwile ukuba. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Mu kamfukwefukwe kamo kene tekuti mufume amenshi yabune na yakikelekese. <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Umukunyu, mwe bawesu, tekuti utwale ifitwalo fya muolife, no mwangashi nao tekuti utwalike imikunyu. Kimo na kamfukwemfukwe ka menshi yakikelekese tekuti kafumye amenshi yabune.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amano yakufuma kuli Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Ni nani pali mwebo uwa mano kabili uwakukengela? Uyo afwile ukulanga ati wa mano kabili wakukengela ku mikitile yakwe iyabune mu fintu akokita mu kuikyefya kwa mano muli fyonse ifyo akokita. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Nomba nga mwaliba no mufimbila sana no kuisakamana mwe bene, ninshi mukoibepa fye tapali kishinka kya kuitakishapo. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Amano yakubefi tekuli Lesa yaafuma, mano ya pano kyalo ya buntunse fye, kabili yalafuma ku mipashi ya bubi. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Pantu uko kuli umufimbila na bukaitemwe, ekuba ne kimfulunganya ne misango yonse iyabubi. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Lelo amano yakufuma kwiulu yena yaliba aya kusanguluka, kabili ya mutende, ya mutembo no bufuke. Elo kabili yalikwatisha uluse, yakita fye ifyabune. Tayaba na kapatulula, yaliba pa kishinka. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Ukuba abololoke pa kinso kyakwa Lesa, efisabo basombola abo abalinda umutende.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Mwilekubika bulunda ne kyalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Bushe ubulaki no kulwa filafuma pii? Bushe tekukonkelela ulunkumbwa lwabubi ululwisha mu mibili yenu? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Mulafwaya ukukwata ifintu lelo tamukwata, ekyo mwipailapo na bantu. Mulasubila ukukwata ifintu lelo tamukwata, ekyo mulakila no kulekulwilapo. Tamukwata ifyo mufwaya pantu tamulomba kuli Lesa. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Ekyo tamupokelela fintu ulo mukolomba, nikyo mulalomba na mapange yabubi. Mulalomba ifintu fya kumisansamusha fye mwe bene. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Mwe bantu baalukila Lesa mwe! Bushe tamwaishiba ati ukupanga ubulunda ne kyalo kuba umulwani wakwa Lesa? Uufwaya bukibusa ne kyalo alaikita umulwini wakwa Lesa. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Mwilekutontonkanya ati te fyakishinka ifyalembwa mu malembo ya Mushilo ifisosa ati, “Lesa alitutemwa sana, kabili alatufubila pa mulandu wa Mupashi abika muli fwebo.” <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Lelo kwena Lesa ikikuuku atukwatila kyalikilapo. Efyo kyalilembwa ati, “Lesa akinkitila abakilumba, lelo abaikyefya bena alabakwatila ikikuuku.” <verse eid="JAS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Kanshi mulekunakila Lesa. Mulekwansha Ikiwa, nakyo kya lekumibutuka. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Mulekupalamina kuli Lesa, naye alekupamina kuli mwebo. Sambeni iminwe yenu mwebo mwe balubembu! Mule kusangulula imitima yenu mwe bamyalumyalu! <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Mulekuba no bulanda, lileni no kuloosha. Mulekuleka inseko shenu shaluke misowa, ne nsansa shibe ubulanda. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Mulekuba abakuikefya pa kinso kyakwa Shikulu, naye akamisansabalika.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulwambo tekwesha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Mwe bawesu, mwilekwambana. Uyo onse uukoamba nangu ukumupeela umulandu, alasuula amafunde yakwa Lesa nangula ukuyalengulula. Ekyo ngo kolengulula amafunde, ninshi taukoyakonka awe, ukoyalengulula fye. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Lesa eka eupeela amafunde no kupingula abantu. Kabili eka fye ewaba na maka ya kupususha abantu nangula ukubalofya. Nga we ni webo nani uwakupingula umunobe?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amataki tekwesha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Kamumfwa mwebo mwe balanda ati, “Lelo nangula mailo tukaya ku musumba uukindami. Tukaya kupwako umwaka umo. Tukalekukita amakwebo no kunonkako indalama.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Tamwishibile nga kyakwebati mukaba aba mweo mailo. Mwebo mwaliba fye nga kaamfwa uuboneka pa kashita akanini, kabili mwaluba nepo ele. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Efyo mulingile ukusosa nifi, “Shikulu nga kofwaya tukabe aba mweo, tukakita fyakuti na fyakuti.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Nomba mwebo mulakita ikilumba no kuleitakisha. Amataki yonse aya musango uyu, yabubi. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Ekyo kanshi umuntu onse uwaishiba ifyabune ifintu afwile ukulakita, nomba nga takokita, ninshi akobembuka.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Mwe bakankala kengeleni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Kamumfwa mwe bakankala. Mulekulila iminsoshi, mulekupuma ne misowa pa mulandu wa makyushi yakomishila. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Ifyuma fyenu filibolele ne nsalu shenu balilile ku miswa. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Golide na silfele nafilikwa ne ndalabwa. Ishi ndalabwa shikaba kambone wa kumishinina. Shikonaula umubili wenu kubati mulilo. Mwebo muliitutikile ifyuma muli shino nshiku shakulekelesha. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Boneni, amalipilo mwafililwe ukulipila ababomfi ababombele mu mabala yenu. Imisowa yabali kusombola ilifikile ku matwi yakwa Shikulu wa Maka Yonse. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Mu bumi bwenu pano kyalo mulapoosa indalama ishakuti ubwingi mufyakuisekesha no kuilemena mwe bene. Ekyo nomba muli inishe kukupekanya ku bushiku bwa kwipaiwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Ni mwebo mupingwila abantu bakaele ukufwa, no kwipaya mulabepaya, nabo tabakaanako yii.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulekuteka imitima no kushipikisha mu makyushi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Mwebo bawesu, ala mulekuteka imitima mpaka nelo Shikulu akabwela. Boneni efyo umulimi ateka umutima pakupembela ifisabo fyabune mpaka fikule fipye mwibala imfula ya pakubala ne ya kulekelela. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Ekyo kanshi na mwebo mulekuteka imitima, mwilekunenuka, pantu ubushiku bwa kwisa kwakwa Shikulu bulipaleme.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Na mwebo bawesu, nangu umo elekuisosha pafyo umunakwe akokita, epakwebati mwikapingulwa. Kapingula alimakene pa mwenshi. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Mwe bawesu mulekwibukisha bakasesema abo Lesa atumine mukulanda amashiwi yakwe. Lekeni babe kilangililo kyenu mukuteka imitima ulo mukokyula. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Boneni balya bakoshipikisha mu makyushi, ebo tweba ukushuka. Mwalyumfwa ukushipikisha kwakwa Yobo. Mulishibile ifyo Shikulu amulambwile pakulekelesha, pantu Shikulu alikwatisha inkumbu no luse.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Bawesu nkomikonkobesha sana ati, mwilekulapa umulapo pakulaya ikilayo. Mwilekulapa iulu, nangu isonde, nangula fye mulapo umbi onse. Mwebo mulekulanda fye “Ee,” nga ni ee. “Ayii,” nga ni ayii. Epakwebati Lesa ekamipingula.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipepo lya kiketekelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Umo pali mwebo nga kokyula, alekupepa. Umo pali mwebo nga likwete insansa, naembe inyimbo shakulumbanya Lesa. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Umo pali mwebo nga lilwele, akuute bakilolo ba lukuta, pakwebati baisa kumupepelako no kumusuba mafuta mwishina lyakwa Shikulu. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />No mulwele akapola ikyo abakomupepela balikwete ikisumino. Shikulu akamuposha no kumubelela uluse nga alibifishe. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Mulekwebana ifya membu shenu, no kulaipepela epakwebati mulekupola. Ipepo lya muntu umololoke pa kinso kyakwa Lesa lyaliba na maka sana. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Eliya ali fye muntu nga fwebo. Alipepele kuli Lesa pa maka ati aleshe mfula ukuloka. Elo na pa myaka itatu ne myeshi mutanda takwali mfula mu kyalo. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Alishile ku lomba na kabili, ne ulu lyaliloseshe mfula no mushili walimeseshe ifisabo fyauko.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Mwe bawesu, umo pali mwebo nga aaluka, afuma na mu nshila yakishinka, elo umbi amwalulula na kabili, mwishibe iki. <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />Uyu muntu wa alulula umubifi ukufuma ku mibele yakwe ya lubembu, ninshi akapususha ulya muntu ku mfwa kabili akafimba pa fya bubifi ifyakuti ubwingi.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>